title: "From Gradient to Transformer to Circuit"
abstract: >-
  Training small decoder-only transformers and reverse-engineering what they
  learn: superposition geometry, induction heads, grokking on modular addition,
  activation/path patching and sparse autoencoders, with every public number
  traced to a committed run manifest.
